[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561995543","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2561995543","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2561995543,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YtPMX","user":{"login":"dalexeev","id":47700418,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ3NzAwNDE4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/47700418?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev","html_url":"https://github.com/dalexeev","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dalexeev/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-25T20:38:10Z","updated_at":"2024-12-25T20:38:10Z","body":"1. This should work not only for `uid://` but also for `res://`.\r\n2. For consistency with other tooltips, I suggest using the following format:\r\n   * Format: `Resource <file name>: <Type>`\r\n   * Example: `Resource icon.png: CompressedTexture2D`\r\n   * Or maybe: `Resource res://icon.png: CompressedTexture2D`\r\n   * Rationale: Documentation uses Pascal style (`var name: Type`) instead of C style (`Type name`).\r\n   * Also, we can make the resource type links clickable. You can probably reuse `SYMBOL_HINT_ASSIGNABLE`.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2561995543/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2562009411","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2562009411","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2562009411,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YtSlD","user":{"login":"larspet","id":16100387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTAwMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16100387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet","html_url":"https://github.com/larspet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-25T22:05:37Z","updated_at":"2024-12-25T22:05:37Z","body":"> 1. This should work not only for `uid://` but also for `res://`.\r\n\r\nMakes sense, I will add that.\r\n\r\n>     2. For consistency with other tooltips, I suggest using the following format:\r\n>\r\n>        * Format: `Resource <file name>: <Type>`\r\n>        * Example: `Resource icon.png: CompressedTexture2D`\r\n>        * Or maybe: `Resource res://icon.png: CompressedTexture2D`\r\n\r\n`Resource <file_name>: <Type>` is probably good, but I would not want `Resource <file_path>: <Type>` because paths can get pretty long, which is why i first decided on `<Type> <file_name> <file_path>`.\r\n\r\nI will try adding the full resource path to the tooltip body instead of having it in the title.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2562009411/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2563058821","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2563058821","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2563058821,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6YxSyF","user":{"login":"larspet","id":16100387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTAwMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16100387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet","html_url":"https://github.com/larspet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-12-26T19:49:20Z","updated_at":"2024-12-26T19:49:20Z","body":"I have now added support for `res://` as well. Since you can link to more types of files with `res://` I split everything into different types:\r\n\r\n- `Resource`\r\n- `Directory`\r\n- `TextFile` (as defined by the `docks/filesystem/textfile_extensions` editor setting)\r\n- `File` (files that are not visible in `FileSystem`, opens in File Manager instead)","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2563058821/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569959754","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2569959754","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2569959754,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZLnlK","user":{"login":"larspet","id":16100387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTAwMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16100387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet","html_url":"https://github.com/larspet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-04T00:23:46Z","updated_at":"2025-01-04T00:23:46Z","body":"I made an attempt to make the width of the tooltip match the content width, but couldn't get it working because of problems similar to #93040. I do think it would make these tooltips look much nicer (regular code-related tooltips are good as they are however), but I'll leave it for someone with more `Control` knowledge to hopefully implement in another PR.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2569959754/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578625678","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2578625678","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2578625678,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZsrSO","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-08T20:42:48Z","updated_at":"2025-01-08T20:42:48Z","body":"I opened a very similar PR:\r\n#101309\r\nThe difference is that it shows both path and UID for hovered files and includes the preview.\r\nWhile the preview is questionable, showing full path could be useful.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578625678/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578986456","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2578986456","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2578986456,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ZuDXY","user":{"login":"larspet","id":16100387,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MTAwMzg3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16100387?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet","html_url":"https://github.com/larspet","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/larspet/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-09T01:02:23Z","updated_at":"2025-01-09T01:02:23Z","body":"> I opened a very similar PR: #101309 The difference is that it shows both path and UID for hovered files and includes the preview. While the preview is questionable, showing full path could be useful.\r\n\r\nThe reason I didn't show the full path for `res://` was since you're already hovering the full path. Also, the type of the resource is shown after the name, so a long path would push it far away. The full path is shown for UIDs though.\r\n\r\nI don't think the preview is questionable. I was thinking of adding that too but it would've been a little troublesome with how I implemented this PR, but your PR made me rethink my implementation a little.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nOverall, i like the design of my PR's tooltip since it's consistent with the existing `ScriptEditor` tooltips (especially after dalexeev's suggestions). I think it's important to not mix styles within the same context. However, I was very limited with what I could do with the tooltip body since I chose to implement it all using the existing tooltip RTL (slightly hacky in some parts).\r\n\r\nI'm thinking of keeping the header as is (and keeping the detection of different kinds of file types), but implement the tooltip body using normal Controls instead of using the RTL. \r\nThat way I can replace the links with normal buttons like\r\n- Open\r\n- Show in FileSystem\r\n- Copy Path\r\n- Copy UID\r\n\r\nand put a preview to the right of the buttons.\r\n\r\n\r\nThis would make the tooltip much easier to maintain in the future, and also make it easier to add more features.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\nFinally, I/we have forgotten about `user://` paths. They would definitely benefit from tooltips as well.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2578986456/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590056579","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2590056579","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2590056579,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aYSCD","user":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-01-14T14:24:00Z","updated_at":"2025-01-14T14:24:00Z","body":"I gave this a test and it works great, I think it's good enough for a start. There are some corner cases, like files that don't exist in FileSystem (e.g. try opening `res://.godot/editor`, the link does nothing), also I'm pretty sure users will expect this to work with relative paths and absolute paths (without `res://`), but these can be resolved later.\r\n\r\n> Finally, I/we have forgotten about user:// paths. They would definitely benefit from tooltips as well.\r\n\r\nNot really. `user://` does not store \"permanent\" files; they may exist or not, or their type might change. Showing them in tooltip does not provide any useful information. Though I suppose a fast link could be useful, so they could be supported in tooltips even for completeness sake.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590056579/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2590069505","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100803#issuecomment-2590069505","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/100803","id":2590069505,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6aYVMB","user":{"login":"